Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0vi741BLMGl2QPeTXWeG2w","review_id":"X2hgZGpPgQWI_P8kr1gDAA","date":"2019-09-16T00:26:44","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9367617964744568,"text_excerpt":"Still remains one of my favorite greasy spoon diners. Each time I'm in NOLA I make a breakfast stop. I had the omelet with grits and a biscuit today. Service was good. Our wait staff was pleasant and attentive. Food came out quickly. It is New Orleans so there is a full service bar. Others in my party today had French Toast and Red Beans and Rice. All were happily stuffed at the end of our meal."},{"business_id":"0vi741BLMGl2QPeTXWeG2w","review_id":"torf1IhnkjDeqoJWWXp4hg","date":"2011-03-16T01:53:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.931930422782898,"text_excerpt":"This is my go-to breakfast place in NOLA. No frills or whistles, but it is predictable decent food. Service: Um, don't expect the best service in the world. Especially when it comes to being seated. They tend to ignore you until they have a table for you, but I expect it now. The waiters are you typical diner waiters. They want your order and may give you a little 'tude, but the kinda attitude that makes you feel like family. Food: I have eaten the french toast at least 5 times....clearly I love it. I tiptoe the line of gluttony when it comes to this place...as I always finish my food. One occasion I had the chilli cheese burger...I ate it ALL. The sides (fries, bacon, eggs) are nothing s..."},{"business_id":"0vi741BLMGl2QPeTXWeG2w","review_id":"XsGvYx-v6eobH7296LjmYQ","date":"2010-03-02T05:03:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9274278879165649,"text_excerpt":"This place is great for breakfast. I always have the center cut pork chops, which you can order fried, battered or grilled, with eggs and hash browns. A couple of caveats, though: if you don't like your scrambled eggs runny, then let your server know, 'cause they come as runny as runny gets; their hash browns are real potatoes (no scattered, covered, diced and peppered here!). The service is speedy and friendly, and the place fills up fast. This place is very reminiscent of Brian's Eatery in San Diego, CA, minus the exorbitant prices. Oh, and my server, Colleen, was very pleasant throughout my experience."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0vi741BLMGl2QPeTXWeG2w","photo_id":"dtgyIYnSsvY3yLbmTkrpOw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/dtgyIYnSsvY3yLbmTkrpOw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9124817848205566},{"business_id":"0vi741BLMGl2QPeTXWeG2w","photo_id":"JQsDjKh7pP2niTd1YuiN0A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JQsDjKh7pP2niTd1YuiN0A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8084577918052673},{"business_id":"0vi741BLMGl2QPeTXWeG2w","photo_id":"D873-204vzmQ2l6Vn15UTg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/D873-204vzmQ2l6Vn15UTg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7544146180152893},{"business_id":"0vi741BLMGl2QPeTXWeG2w","photo_id":"YY1mv5GH1K-dIkSns6v2uQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/YY1mv5GH1K-dIkSns6v2uQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7078354358673096}]},"notebook_case":null}
